hardyaka-payoneer:greenhouse:7708721.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title and Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive Assistant to the SVP, India&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Gurugram, India (Payoneer India GCC)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our global fintech footprint expands, the Payoneer India Global Capability Centre (GCC) serves as a critical engine for our future growth, having recently crossed our foundational milestone of 50 team members. We are seeking a highly strategic and proactive Executive Assistant to partner directly with the SVP and India Site Head. In this high-impact role, you will act as a vital force multiplier, optimizing executive bandwidth, streamlining daily site operations, and ensuring seamless cross-functional alignment as we scale our Gurugram operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command the Executive Calendar:&lt;/strong&gt; Ruthlessly prioritize the SVP’s time against key strategic objectives, site-wide initiatives, and shifting global priorities, ensuring optimal daily productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Automated Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and implement automated processes to streamline approvals, expense reporting, and operational tracking, moving away from manual data entry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Chief of Staff and global functional leaders to align daily site execution with long-term strategic roadmaps, ensuring swift and accurate information flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Executive Communications:&lt;/strong&gt; Draft, review, and refine high-impact executive communications, all-hands presentations, leadership briefs, and site-wide announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Global Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage complex, multi-leg international and domestic travel itineraries, anticipating logistical hurdles, securing visas, and preparing comprehensive briefing materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Leadership Cadence:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the operational rhythm of the India leadership team by building targeted agendas, capturing actionable insights, and relentlessly tracking deliverables to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate High-Profile Visits:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct end-to-end logistics for visiting global executives, managing facility readiness, localized event programming, and cross-team scheduling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safeguard Confidentiality:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage highly sensitive organizational, financial, and personnel information with absolute discretion, functioning as a trusted vault for site leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Site Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal culture-building initiatives, leadership offsites, and team-building events to maintain high employee engagement as the GCC scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triage and Resolve:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the first line of defense for incoming requests and communications, resolving operational bottlenecks independently before they escalate to the SVP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Communications, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of total professional experience, with at least 3 years explicitly supporting a senior executive (VP or C-suite) in a fast-paced, matrixed corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, demonstrating the ability to distill complex, global communications into clear, actionable executive summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in enterprise productivity suites (Microsoft 365, Teams, SharePoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proactive problem-solving abilities; a track record of anticipating executive needs and neutralizing roadblocks before they occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence, resilience, and the interpersonal agility to build strong, high-trust relationships across diverse global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with low-code/no-code platforms (e.g., Microsoft Power Platform, Power Automate, Microsoft Lists) to independently build and deploy operational efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting leadership during the rapid scaling of a Global Capability Centre (GCC) or a high-growth technology startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience within a global fintech, financial services, or payments organization is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of supporting an executive through significant organizational transformation and physical site establishment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume full, autonomous control of the SVP’s calendar and inbox, successfully reclaiming at least 20% of their weekly bandwidth for deep strategic focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and launch a centralized, automated tracking system for leadership action items and site-wide operational deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high-trust relationships with key global stakeholders and local teams, establishing yourself as the recognized and highly reliable gateway to the India Site Head.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seamlessly execute end-to-end logistics for at least one major site event or global executive visit, delivering a flawless experience without operational escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build each other up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping each other grow, as professionals and people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a business, a community, and a mission you want to be part of, apply today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing a diverse and inclusive workplace. Payoneer is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment no matter your race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any stage of the hiring process, please speak to the recruiter managing the role for any adjustments. Decisions about requests for reasonable accommodation are made on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

