&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A take home team to be able to say yes to new referrals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fill in staffing gaps to meet the needs of existing clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
