&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Commit to working agreed upon shifts&lt;br&gt;Willingness to work in all assigned homes&lt;br&gt;Willingness to train to the top of your license&amp;nbsp;(infant, pediatric, adult, trach and/or vent, and&amp;nbsp;IVs)&lt;br&gt;Willingness to precept onboarding nurses&lt;br&gt;Commitment to attend school with clients if&amp;nbsp;applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
