&lt;h1 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Director, Skilled Nursing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking an experienced, compassionate, and operationally strong Director to lead our Minneapolis Adult Skilled nursing office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;BAYADA’s Skilled Nursing practice delivers expert, compassionate care for medically fragile children and adults in the home, including clients with complex needs such as tracheostomy and ventilator support, seizure management, and tube feedings. Our offices are supported by strong leadership, clinical mentorship, and BAYADA’s best-in-class home health infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;This Director position is ideal for a proven leader who can successfully manage office operations, build high-performing teams, drive operational excellence, and partner across functions to deliver outstanding client service and quality care. This role requires in-person leadership, coaching, support, and oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;Why this opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;If you are looking for an extraordinary growth and leadership opportunity with a top company in a fast-growing healthcare industry, this could be the role for you. At BAYADA, we believe our clients and their families deserve home health care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability. We are looking for a leader who can bring vision, accountability, and heart to two important offices serving both adult and pediatric skilled nursing populations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdntd&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Lead the overall operations, performance, and service delivery of the Minneapolis Adult Skilled nursing office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Establish BAYADA as the home care employer and provider of choice in each local market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Manage key performance indicators, growth goals, quality expectations, service standards, and financial objectives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Provide direct leadership, coaching, and development to office team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Build strong, engaged office cultures rooted in The BAYADA Way&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Partner with clinical, client services, recruiting, and operational leaders to ensure cohesive office performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Hire, develop, and retain high-potential office employees and support succession planning for key roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Guide teams in delivering exceptional client service and high-quality care to adult and pediatric clients&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Identify, develop, and support business growth opportunities within the office and market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Provide consultation and support on budgeting, financial performance, and office-level initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Monitor quality and appropriateness of services and respond to client or personnel concerns as needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Promote teamwork, urgency, accountability, and strong communication&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Support office coverage and step in operationally as needed during periods of change, vacancy, or increased business demand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with BAYADA policies, procedures, and applicable regulatory requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdntd&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Four-year college degree required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Minimum five years of supervisory experience, preferably in healthcare, home care, social service management, staffing, or service operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success as a Director or similar leadership role in a comparable organization preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal, communication, coaching, and relationship-building skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Demonstrated record of goal achievement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Proven ability to take on increasing responsibility with positive results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Strong financial, organizational, and problem-solving skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Ability to lead with flexibility in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is a servant leader who can balance strategy with execution. They are equally comfortable developing people, solving operational challenges, supporting growth, and maintaining a strong in-office presence. They lead by example, create a sense of urgency, build trust, and foster a positive, accountable team culture. BAYADA’s director role emphasizes leading team performance, being accessible, backing up the team during peak activity, developing office employees, and creating a positive work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdntg _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;Why BAYADA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;BAYADA believes that our employees are our greatest asset. We offer the stability and support of a nationally recognized home health care organization with the culture of a mission-driven local team. This is an exciting opportunity for a leader who wants to make a meaningful impact across multiple offices while helping more clients live safely, comfortably, and with dignity at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Apply today to become part of BAYADA’s mission-driven leadership team and help shape the future of care in our Minneapolis Adult Skilled Nursing offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxScXOg6sdY?si=goqnSEGLWYAq7CQY&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LIRX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#JoinBAYADA-RX&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is celebrating 50 years of compassion, excellence, and reliability. Learn more about our 50th anniversary celebration and how you can join in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/50&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care, Inc., and its associated entities and joint venture partners, are Equal Opportunity Employers. All employment decisions are made on a non-discriminatory basis without regard to sex, race, color, age, disability, pregnancy or maternity, sexual orientation, gender identity, citizenship status, military status, or any other similarly protected status in accordance with federal, state and local laws. &amp;nbsp;Hence, we strongly encourage applications from people with these identities or who are members of other marginalized communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

